+<body>
+<svg style="display:none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><symbol id="grid" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></symbol><symbol id="copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"/></symbol><symbol id="info" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5m0-9v.1"/></symbol><symbol id="lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></symbol></svg>
+<aside class="sidebar"><a href="./" class="brand" aria-label="Typeform home"><span class="brand-icon">tf</span>typeform<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><div class="workspace">THE WORKSPACE</div><nav aria-label="Workspace"><a class="nav-link active" href="#playground" aria-current="page"><svg><use href="#grid"/></svg>Typography lab</a></nav><div class="nav-bottom"><span class="tiny-dot"></span>A small tool for better type.</div></aside>
+<div class="app"><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <strong>Typography lab</strong></div><div class="top-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 3 1.9 6.1L20 11l-6.1 1.9L12 19l-1.9-6.1L4 11l6.1-1.9L12 3Z"/></svg>Made for the details</div></header>
+<main class="content" id="playground"><div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span></span>The typography playground</div><h1>Different fonts. <em>Same rhythm.</em></h1><p>A little harmony goes a long way. Bring mixed fonts into balance<br class="desktop-break"> with automatic, optical sizing.</p></div><span class="version">CSS / font-size-adjust</span></div>
+<section class="toolbar" aria-label="Preview controls"><div class="toolbar-left"><div class="control"><label class="control-label" for="font-family">Base font</label><select class="font-select" id="font-family"><option value="Arial, sans-serif">Arial · Sans serif</option><option value="Verdana, sans-serif">Verdana · Sans serif</option><option value="Georgia, serif">Georgia · Serif</option></select></div><span class="divider"></span><div class="control size-control"><label class="control-label" for="font-size">Size</label><input id="font-size" type="range" min="18" max="32" value="24"><output for="font-size" class="size-value" id="size-value">24 px</output></div></div><button class="reset" id="reset" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 1 7M3 4v6h6"/></svg>Reset</button></section>
+<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><div class="card-title"><span class="number">01</span><h2>Mixed fonts, in harmony</h2><span class="badge">Automatic</span></div><label class="switch-label">Normalize heights<input type="checkbox" id="normalize" checked aria-label="Normalize mixed font heights"></label></div><div class="preview"><div class="preview-meta"><span class="preview-label">LIVE PREVIEW</span><div class="font-legend"><span><i class="legend-dot"></i><span id="font-name">Arial</span></span><span><i class="legend-dot orange"></i>IBM Plex Mono</span></div></div><div id="mixed-fonts-container">Good typography feels effortless. Even when you mix regular text with <code>inline code</code>, every word should feel like it belongs. Let <code>font-size-adjust</code> find the balance.</div><p class="preview-description">One consistent x-height. A more comfortable reading experience.</p></div><div class="code-bar"><div class="code-line"><span class="property">font-size-adjust</span>: <span class="value" id="automatic-value">from-font</span>;<span class="comment">/* let the font lead */</span></div><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="automatic" aria-label="Copy automatic adjustment CSS"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></section>
+<section class="card second"><div class="card-head"><div class="card-title"><span class="number">02</span><h2>A theme of its own</h2><span class="badge">Independent</span></div><span class="theme-info"><svg><use href="#lock"/></svg>Fixed proportions</span></div><div class="theme-preview"><div class="preview-meta"><span class="theme-label">THE EDITORIAL THEME</span><span class="theme-tag"><svg><use href="#lock"/></svg>x-height · 0.5</span></div><div id="independent-theme-container">A different voice, with its own sense of proportion. This theme pairs a classic serif with <code>monospace</code> — held together by a fixed x-height.</div><p class="theme-copy">An independent font family. A deliberately consistent visual size.</p></div><div class="code-bar"><div class="code-line"><span class="property">font-size-adjust</span>: <span class="value">0.5</span>;<span class="comment">/* a rhythm of its own */</span></div><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="independent" aria-label="Copy independent theme CSS"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></section>
+<aside class="info"><svg><use href="#info"/></svg><div><h3>Small property. Noticeable difference.</h3><p><code>font-size-adjust</code> preserves the perceived size of text using the font’s x-height. Use <code>from-font</code> to follow your primary font, or a numeric value to set an independent rhythm.<span class="unsupported"> Your browser uses the carefully sized fallback.</span></p></div></aside><footer class="footer"><span>Thoughtful type, down to the lowercase.</span><span><span class="tiny-dot"></span>Built with modern CSS</span></footer>
+</main></div>
+<script>
+const family = document.querySelector('#font-family');
+const size = document.querySelector('#font-size');
+const normalize = document.querySelector('#normalize');
+const mixed = document.querySelector('#mixed-fonts-container');
+function updatePreview(){
+  mixed.style.fontFamily = family.value;
+  document.querySelector('#font-name').textContent = family.selectedOptions[0].textContent.split(' · ')[0];
+  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--sample-size', `${Number(size.value) / 16}rem`);
+  document.querySelector('#size-value').value = `${size.value} px`;
+  mixed.style.fontSizeAdjust = normalize.checked ? 'from-font' : 'none';
+  document.querySelector('#automatic-value').textContent = normalize.checked ? 'from-font' : 'none';
+}
+family.addEventListener('change', updatePreview);
+size.addEventListener('input', updatePreview);
+normalize.addEventListener('change', updatePreview);
+document.querySelector('#reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{family.selectedIndex=0;size.value='24';normalize.checked=true;updatePreview();});
+document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
+ const independent = button.dataset.copy === 'independent';
+ const css = independent ? '#independent-theme-container {\n  font-family: Georgia, serif;\n  font-size-adjust: 0.5;\n}' : `#mixed-fonts-container {\n  font-family: ${family.value};\n  font-size-adjust: ${normalize.checked ? 'from-font' : 'none'};\n}\n#mixed-fonts-container code {\n  font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;\n}`;
+ try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(css);button.textContent='Copied!';setTimeout(()=>{button.innerHTML='<svg><use href="#copy"/></svg>';},1800);}catch{button.textContent='Copy unavailable';setTimeout(()=>{button.innerHTML='<svg><use href="#copy"/></svg>';},2000);}
+}));
+updatePreview();
+</script>
+</body>
